// Ownership:
//   - SchedulerService is implemented by the Scheduler process. It owns task
//     definitions, time rules, occurrence materialization, claims/leases,
//     start authorization and the scheduling status projection.
//   - SchedulerControlService is implemented by the main service (API/all).
//     It owns task-resource versions and the authoritative model/owner
//     validation. Scheduler calls it before persisting a task configuration.
//   - Occurrence history (ListOccurrences/GetOccurrence) is scheduler-owned;
//     task-session content and resource bytes are main-service owned.
